@title New cabinet: a STEP file of another article shows both numbers and the file's size wins
@area Cabinet
# Where the user finds it: Outline > New cabinet > Enclosure > Choose file...
user_catalog qa/fixtures/enclosure-parts.json
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
click_text "New cabinet..." Button
wait 10
click_text "Demo TS-600x1800x500"
wait 6
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/enclosure-step/TS-800x1800x500.stp
click_text "Choose file…" Button
wait 30
expect "file says"
expect "Width: file 800 mm"
expect "800 x 1800 x 500 mm"
shot a-differs
check_layout
